    [PAUSE|4.0]
    [000|NARRATOR_NATIVE_en_lantern|0.88] A low warm light touches what is nearest. The rest of the room can wait.
    [PAUSE|3.5]
    [001|NARRATOR_NATIVE_en|0.84] The nearest surface is cool under your hand. A small sound repeats in the same place. The air does not hurry. You stay with that sound.
    [PAUSE|1.5]
    [002|NARRATOR_NATIVE_en|0.84] The same place is still around you. The light is lower than before. A quiet texture meets your hand.
    [PAUSE|1.5]

